# a power cut in the middle of a save (fm1-x0x#17, #20): the next start loads the save before, from the
# objects' previous copies, not the defaults. Random hits pack badly, so the stream spans several objects
# and the cut leaves its first object new and the rest old.
wait 300
fillrandom 1
tap SAVE
wait 300
snapproj
reboot
wait 300
expect projsame 1
fillrandom 2
tearsave 1
tap SAVE
wait 300
reboot
wait 300
expect projsame 1
expect mempct >30
fillrandom 3
tap SAVE
wait 300
snapproj
reboot
wait 300
expect projsame 1
